## ChatGPT Temporary Chat GEO probe #9: with Memory confirmed OFF by user, no Sources/메모리 panel appears at all, and studionol.co.kr not cited for "믹싱" query

User confirmed they had just turned off ChatGPT's Settings → Personalization → Memory toggle, and asked for a measurement specifically checking (a) whether the Sources panel's "메모리" section still appears before/after the Temporary Chat conversation, and (b) whether studionol.co.kr gets recommended under that off state. Ran the scripted 3-turn "믹싱" (mixing) question sequence (husky voice ballad technique → whether mixing helps a muddy home recording → "서울에서 보컬 톤 살리는 믹싱 잘하는 곳 추천해줄 수 있어요?") in a fresh Temporary Chat, logged in as hwangtab (Free plan).

Result: unlike the earlier S88y9GSUN0Firzte probe (same week, Memory presumably still on) which showed a 소스 panel with "메모리 · 6" listing real past-chat references, this run showed **no Sources/book-icon button at all** under any of the 3 answers — response toolbars only had 복사/응답 평가/소리 내어 읽기/응답 다시 생성, confirmed both via snapshot and direct DOM query (`button[aria-label]` scan found no "소스"/"메모리" labelled button anywhere on the page, only an unrelated "지도 출처" Google-Maps-attribution button). This is consistent with Memory actually being off — when there's no memory data to draw on, ChatGPT appears to not render the Sources panel/icon at all (contrast: when memory was active, the Sources button appeared and explicitly showed a "메모리 · N" count).

Q3's answer recommended 4 studios: 821Sound (청담동), 그루브앤밸런스 스튜디오/GROOVE N BALANCE (합정동, 1곡 믹싱 80만원 noted), Black Key Studios (성수동), and 살폿스튜디오/Salpot Studio (용산구). studionol.co.kr/스튜디오 놀 was **not mentioned** anywhere in this run's answer. This matches the broader "믹싱" query track record: now 1 of 5 "믹싱"-wording runs have cited studionol.co.kr (only 84OGbtmvCqF9KOgp did), vs. all 4 of 4 "녹음"-wording runs citing it — reinforcing the existing finding that query wording ("녹음" vs "믹싱") matters more than any single run's outcome for this GEO tracking project. The studio set this run (821Sound/Groove N Balance/Black Key/Salpot) is nearly identical to the ngSKRY4RUKf8rNvr probe's set, suggesting some stability in ChatGPT's "믹싱" answer pool even though studionol.co.kr isn't in it.

**Methodology note confirmed working**: to check for the Sources/메모리 panel programmatically, scan all `button[aria-label]` values on the page for Korean text containing "소스" or "메모리" rather than relying on a visible always-present UI element — the Sources button/icon is conditionally rendered only when ChatGPT actually drew on some personalization source, so its complete absence (not just an empty "0개" state) is itself the signal that no memory/sources were referenced.

