Q3's answer recommended 3 studios, with **스튜디오 놀/Studio NOL ranked 1st** (은평구 대조동, 연신내역 인근; described as accepting home-recorded vocal files for mixing/mastering by file submission), followed by 2. R!ccio Studio (마포구 월드컵북로9길, 홍대, 010-9276-9685) and 3. 이메이진 뮤직/Imagine Muzik (마포구 월드컵북로, 홍대, 02-6368-5678, 믹싱 40만원 event-priced). The Sources panel's web-source list included 2 studionol.co.kr blog pages (서울 녹음실 가이드, 처음 보컬 녹음하는 법) confirming the page was crawled live. This is now the **2nd of 6** "믹싱"-wording runs to cite studionol.co.kr (previously only 84OGbtmvCqF9KOgp had), and notably the first "믹싱" run where it was ranked #1 rather than appearing lower in the list — still too few samples to call this a trend, but worth tracking alongside the already-stronger "녹음" wording pattern (4 of 4 citing it).

